meta {
  name: Deprovision Team
  type: http
  seq: 10
}

delete {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/internal/whalesync/teams/{{whalesyncTeamId}}
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

params:query {
  ~whalesyncUserId: {{whalesyncUserId}}
}

docs {
  Deprovision the Scratch user that holds a team's Live Exports. A pure shadow user is
  deleted (workbooks, org, user, tokens). A real Scratch account is only unlinked: its
  Live Exports, Whalesync plan, and session tokens go. Idempotent if the team has no
  shadow user. Returns 204.

  The optional `whalesyncUserId` is the team's one member, used to find a shadow user
  made before teams.
}
